WEBVTT

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:02.285
And hey, even without those risks,
money at home is tempting.

00:02:02.285 --> 00:02:04.245
It's hard to hold on to cash.

00:02:04.704 --> 00:02:08.291
And sometimes, the smartest thing to do
might be to spend it.

00:02:10.084 --> 00:02:14.839
So the real problem that farmers face
is that they lack a safe place to save.

00:02:15.756 --> 00:02:17.216
And if they could save,

00:02:17.258 --> 00:02:20.845
they could afford to buy what they need
to make their farms more productive

00:02:20.887 --> 00:02:22.680
and resilient to climate change.

00:02:23.055 --> 00:02:27.727
This is a 100-billion-dollar problem
in sub-Saharan Africa each year.

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:32.231
Setou, a peanut farmer in Mali,
was facing a similar challenge.